{
  "readme": "<div align=\"center\">\n\n<img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2208c700-c5d1-4128-86a2-508d73ff1a01\" alt=\"HyperOS Security Center Mod\" width=\"100%\"/>\n\n# HyperOS Security Center Mod\n\n**The HyperOS Security Center with extra tools, unlocked features and no root or account restrictions.**\n\n[![Release](https://img.shields.io/github/v/release/Mods-Center/HyperOS-Security-Center?style=for-the-badge&label=release&color=0a84ff)](https://github.com/Mods-Center/HyperOS-Security-Center/releases/latest)\n[![Downloads](https://img.shields.io/github/downloads/Mods-Center/HyperOS-Security-Center/total?style=for-the-badge&color=30d158)](https://github.com/Mods-Center/HyperOS-Security-Center/releases)\n[![Stars](https://img.shields.io/github/stars/Mods-Center/HyperOS-Security-Center?style=for-the-badge&color=ffd60a)](https://github.com/Mods-Center/HyperOS-Security-Center/stargazers)\n[![Telegram](https://img.shields.io/badge/Telegram-channel-26A5E4?style=for-the-badge&logo=telegram&logoColor=white)](https://t.me/kashis_cringey_stuffs)\n\n</div>\n\n## Features\n- **Sidebar**: clipboard and Google Circle to Search shortcuts, saved phrases, two-column layout\n- **Video toolbox**: sleep timer, block heads-up notifications, touch lock\n- **Battery**: custom charging-limit percentage, battery temperature, number of charges today\n- **Game Turbo**: screen ratio and Game Turbo 4 features, glass blur in toolbox and game windows\n- **Apps**: set a custom mobile data limit per app, control Wi-Fi access for system apps, copy the package name with a long-press in app info, disable apps\n- Dual apps, automated tasks and motion-sickness relief unlocked on devices that don't officially support them\n- Root and Mi account restrictions removed, FBO unlocked\n- Translations for Russian, Ukrainian, Indonesian, Turkish and Vietnamese\n\n## Requirements\n- HyperOS\n- Magisk, or KernelSU with a mount module\n\n## Installation\n1. Download the latest zip from [**Releases**](https://github.com/Mods-Center/HyperOS-Security-Center/releases/latest).\n2. Flash it in Magisk, KernelSU or APatch.\n3. On KernelSU, flash a mount module before this one.\n4. Reboot your device.\n\n## Screenshots\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d8829d98-0b0c-44ab-959b-284213af5dd4\" width=\"23%\" alt=\"Security Center\"/>\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a990de79-2c80-4545-8ffb-6525c2e98822\" width=\"23%\" alt=\"Security Center\"/>\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b3b655ea-8097-451f-8ac0-57673aac13eb\" width=\"23%\" alt=\"Security Center\"/>\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c7a7010c-96f0-4f05-bf02-9e75f267c62c\" width=\"23%\" alt=\"Security Center\"/>\n  <br/>\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/97e22fbf-4999-456a-ade2-4aa300c43caf\" width=\"23%\" alt=\"Security Center\"/>\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/eefcce3a-d5b4-496e-991d-e901966f3bec\" width=\"23%\" alt=\"Security Center\"/>\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/071bcc23-a018-439d-bd10-52dc267af9ef\" width=\"23%\" alt=\"Security Center\"/>\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/14ed8386-7de9-4df3-a66f-ee429cb8563a\" width=\"23%\" alt=\"Security Center\"/>\n  <br/>\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9f035b53-9daf-45e1-a752-10fde7eb975a\" width=\"23%\" alt=\"Security Center\"/>\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4c37c3e0-fc10-4c3e-812d-7f70b4b72044\" width=\"23%\" alt=\"Security Center\"/>\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/55e5a78e-859b-42fe-85c0-b6a39f5d08b4\" width=\"23%\" alt=\"Security Center\"/>\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/36612eaa-2c03-4603-833a-787d0b0a5e70\" width=\"23%\" alt=\"Security Center\"/>\n  <br/>\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0ad95683-e0f2-4fe7-b559-87dc8f15c8f0\" 