  "readmeHTML": "<p><div align=\"center\"></p>\n\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2208c700-c5d1-4128-86a2-508d73ff1a01\" alt=\"HyperOS Security Center Mod\" width=\"100%\"/></p>\n\n<h1>HyperOS Security Center Mod</h1>\n\n<p><b>The HyperOS Security Center with extra tools, unlocked features and no root or account restrictions.</b></p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://img.shields.io/github/v/release/Mods-Center/HyperOS-Security-Center?style=for-the-badge&label=release&color=0a84ff\">![Release</a>](https://github.com/Mods-Center/HyperOS-Security-Center/releases/latest)</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://img.shields.io/github/downloads/Mods-Center/HyperOS-Security-Center/total?style=for-the-badge&color=30d158\">![Downloads</a>](https://github.com/Mods-Center/HyperOS-Security-Center/releases)</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://img.shields.io/github/stars/Mods-Center/HyperOS-Security-Center?style=for-the-badge&color=ffd60a\">![Stars</a>](https://github.com/Mods-Center/HyperOS-Security-Center/stargazers)</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Telegram-channel-26A5E4?style=for-the-badge&logo=telegram&logoColor=white\">![Telegram</a>](https://t.me/kashis_cringey_stuffs)</p>\n\n<p></div></p>\n\n<h2>Features</h2>\n<li>**Sidebar**: clipboard and Google Circle to Search shortcuts, saved phrases, two-column layout</li>\n<li>**Video toolbox**: sleep timer, block heads-up notifications, touch lock</li>\n<li>**Battery**: custom charging-limit percentage, battery temperature, number of charges today</li>\n<li>**Game Turbo**: screen ratio and Game Turbo 4 features, glass blur in toolbox and game windows</li>\n<li>**Apps**: set a custom mobile data limit per app, control Wi-Fi access for system apps, copy the package name with a long-press in app info, disable apps</li>\n<li>Dual apps, automated tasks and motion-sickness relief unlocked on devices that don't officially support them</li>\n<li>Root and Mi account restrictions removed, FBO unlocked</li>\n<li>Translations for Russian, Ukrainian, Indonesian, Turkish and Vietnamese</li>\n\n<h2>Requirements</h2>\n<li>HyperOS</li>\n<li>Magisk, or KernelSU with a mount module</li>\n\n<h2>Installation</h2>\n<li>Download the latest zip from [**Releases**](https://github.com/Mods-Center/HyperOS-Security-Center/releases/latest).</li>\n<li>Flash it in Magisk, KernelSU or APatch.</li>\n<li>On KernelSU, flash a mount module before this one.</li>\n<li>Reboot your device.</li>\n\n<h2>Screenshots</h2>\n<p><p align=\"center\"></p>\n<p>  <img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d8829d98-0b0c-44ab-959b-284213af5dd4\" width=\"23%\" alt=\"Security Center\"/></p>\n<p>  <img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a990de79-2c80-4545-8ffb-6525c2e98822\" width=\"23%\" alt=\"Security Center\"/></p>\n<p>  <img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b3b655ea-8097-451f-8ac0-57673aac13eb\" width=\"23%\" alt=\"Security Center\"/></p>\n<p>  <img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c7a7010c-96f0-4f05-bf02-9e75f267c62c\" width=\"23%\" alt=\"Security Center\"/></p>\n<p>  <br/></p>\n<p>  <img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/97e22fbf-4999-456a-ade2-4aa300c43caf\" width=\"23%\" alt=\"Security Center\"/></p>\n<p>  <img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/eefcce3a-d5b4-496e-991d-e901966f3bec\" width=\"23%\" alt=\"Security Center\"/></p>\n<p>  <img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/071bcc23-a018-439d-bd10-52dc267af9ef\" width=\"23%\" alt=\"Security Center\"/></p>\n<p>  <img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/14ed8386-7de9-4df3-a66f-ee429cb8563a\" width=\"23%\" alt=\"Security Center\"/></p>\n<p>  <br/></p>\n<p>  <img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9f035b53-9daf-45e1-a752-10fde7eb975a\" width=\"23%\" alt=\"Security Center\"/></p>\n<p>  <img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4c37c3e0-fc10-4c3e-812d-7f70b4b72044\" width=\"23%\" alt=\"Security Center\"/></p>\n<p>  <img src=\"https://github.com/user-attac